    <item>
      <title>谷歌大模型学会“玩电脑”了！Gemini 2.5 Computer Use，AI彻底放飞自我？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/gemini-25-computer-useai-20251008191006173-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 19:10:06 +0800</pubDate>
